    {
      "Date": "Jan 15 2026",
      "Text": "The parties' proposal for the filing of consolidated briefs is adopted.  Respondent in No. 25-406 and petitioner in No. 25-567 shall file a consolidated opening brief on the merits pursuant to Rule 25.1 and a consolidated reply brief on the merits pursuant to Rule 25.3.  Petitioners in No. 25-406 and respondents in No. 25-567 shall file a consolidated response brief on the merits pursuant to Rule 25.2.    VIDED."
